### Create Round-Trip Pricing
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/pricing-configurations
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": "2b6ea1ef-219d-452b-9e53-f4c98e3b9868",
  "tripType": "CHAUFFEUR_ROUND_TRIP",
  "baseFee": 800,
  "perKmCharge": 16,
  "driverAllowance": 500,
  "minimumBillableKm": 100,
  "includedDurationMinutes": null,
  "includedDistanceKm": null,
  "packagePrice": null,
  "extraHourCharge": null,
  "extraKmCharge": null
}